Breaks: credentials that do not last through their window and the refresh margin get the shared epoch all the same, so another server answers 304 for them until the window ends, inside their margin.
Module: catalog-server
Test: SharedEpochTest#credentialsThatCannotLastTheWindowKeepTheirOwnEpoch+credentialsFromAnStsFarBehindKeepTheirOwnEpoch
diff --git a/catalog-server/src/main/java/nuna/catalog/server/storage/StsCredentialVending.java b/catalog-server/src/main/java/nuna/catalog/server/storage/StsCredentialVending.java
